WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:03.602
Welcome, welcome, welcome
to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.602 --> 00:00:05.538
Thank you for being here.
Thank you for watching.

00:00:05.538 --> 00:00:07.773
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.773 --> 00:00:10.076
Well, guys,
today President Biden

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:12.778
kicked off his European tour
in the U.K.

00:00:12.778 --> 00:00:15.614 line:0%
and met with British
Prime Minister Boris Johnson.

00:00:15.614 --> 00:00:17.951 line:0%
Yeah, at first, Biden didn't
even recognize Johnson.

00:00:17.951 --> 00:00:20.520
He thought he was
a hungover Weasley brother.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.255
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.255 --> 00:00:25.658
But Biden and Johnson
are getting a lot done.

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:28.260
Today, they launched
a task force to reopen travel

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:29.795
between the US and the UK.

00:00:29.795 --> 00:00:31.564
When they heard that,
Harry and Meghan were like,

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:35.301
"You can try all you want..."

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:37.770
That's right --
Biden and Johnson are trying

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:40.072
to reopen travel
between the US and the UK,

00:00:40.072 --> 00:00:42.208
which is great because
it means we're one step closer

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:44.577
to Kamala Harris
finally visiting Europe.

00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:46.446
-And I haven't been to Europe.

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:47.647
-Yeah.

00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:50.049
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.049 --> 00:00:51.484
"I've never been there."

00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:53.286
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:55.288 --> 00:00:57.490
Biden and Johnson
were actually supposed to meet

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:00.359
on a small island before
bad weather changed their plans.

00:01:00.359 --> 00:01:02.061
This is the island right there.
Yeah.

00:01:02.061 --> 00:01:04.063
That's a shame because
I love it when world leaders

00:01:04.063 --> 00:01:06.933
hang out at locations
from "Mario Kart."

00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:09.235
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:12.038
Did you see that cute island?
I mean, come on.

00:01:12.038 --> 00:01:13.439
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.439 --> 00:01:15.708
Meanwhile, if Putin invited you
to a place like that,

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:17.509
you'd be like, "Uh, let's do it
somewhere more public!

00:01:17.509 --> 00:01:21.180
Uh, let's go to the M&amp;M Store."

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:25.785
Yep, Biden and Johnson met at
the site of this weekend's G7,

00:01:25.785 --> 00:01:28.221
and right across the street,
an artist built a sculpture

00:01:28.221 --> 00:01:31.323
of the seven leaders
made out of electronic trash

00:01:31.323 --> 00:01:33.058
and called it
"Mount Recyclemore."

00:01:33.058 --> 00:01:34.994
Take a look at this thing.

00:01:34.994 --> 00:01:37.330
-[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:39.165
It's kind of sad Trump
couldn't even get his face

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:41.033
on Mount Recyclemore.
You know?

00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:42.301
Sad.

00:01:42.301 --> 00:01:43.635
That's right.

00:01:43.635 --> 00:01:45.572
President Biden spent
the whole day over in the UK.

00:01:45.572 --> 00:01:48.107
And you know the British have
some pretty colorful slang,

00:01:48.107 --> 00:01:50.009
but so does President Biden,

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:52.244
so we thought we would put
together a quick tutorial

00:01:52.244 --> 00:01:54.781
on the differences between
how they use certain phrases.

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:57.984
For example, first up,
we have "slag off."

00:01:57.984 --> 00:02:00.753
To someone in England, that
means "to criticize someone."

00:02:00.753 --> 00:02:02.822
But for Biden, it means...

00:02:19.639 --> 00:02:21.707
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:21.707 --> 00:02:23.576
Put hot dogs in his pocket?
-Ew.

00:02:23.576 --> 00:02:25.011
In the shirt pocket.

00:02:25.011 --> 00:02:26.946
-Shirt pockets to keep you cool.
-Yeah, to keep you cool.

00:02:26.946 --> 00:02:28.414
-Yeah. That's interesting.
-Not cooked.

00:02:28.414 --> 00:02:31.551
-Let's look at another example.
We have "Bob's your uncle."

00:02:31.551 --> 00:02:34.119
The British use that to mean
"and there you have it."

00:02:34.119 --> 00:02:36.990
But to Biden...

00:02:53.306 --> 00:02:54.874
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:54.874 --> 00:02:57.977
I -- Squirting?
-Like that?

00:02:57.977 --> 00:02:59.678
-Interesting.
-With holy water?

00:02:59.678 --> 00:03:02.348
-Finally, we have
"throwing a wobbly."

00:03:02.348 --> 00:03:04.717
To the British, it means
"having a tantrum."

00:03:04.717 --> 00:03:06.719
But to Biden...

00:03:20.066 --> 00:03:22.335
Just interesting.
Interesting difference.

00:03:22.335 --> 00:03:23.569
Interesting.

00:03:23.569 --> 00:03:25.304
[ Applause ]

00:03:25.304 --> 00:03:26.906
Hey, this is cool.

00:03:26.906 --> 00:03:29.909
I saw that Mattel just announced
its first line of Barbie dolls

00:03:29.909 --> 00:03:32.344
made from recycled plastic.

00:03:32.344 --> 00:03:34.614
That's great, but, honestly,
I feel like they could have done

00:03:34.614 --> 00:03:36.415
a better job with the name.

00:03:36.415 --> 00:03:39.218
Garbage Barbie. I just --

00:03:39.218 --> 00:03:40.953
-That's not good.
-That's just odd.

00:03:40.953 --> 00:03:42.554
-Yeah.
-Get this.

00:03:42.554 --> 00:03:44.557
7-Eleven just announced
that this year,

00:03:44.557 --> 00:03:47.893
their free Slurpee giveaway
will not just occur on one day,

00:03:47.893 --> 00:03:50.162
but for the entire month
of July.

00:03:50.162 --> 00:03:52.232
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:54.867 --> 00:03:57.503
It's part of their
94th-birthday celebration,

00:03:57.503 --> 00:03:59.671
which means they're almost
as old as the hot dogs

00:03:59.671 --> 00:04:01.541
on the rotating grill.

00:04:01.541 --> 00:04:03.476
[ Laughter ]

00:04:03.476 --> 00:04:05.411
And, finally,
this is very exciting.

00:04:05.411 --> 00:04:07.679
Today Mayor de Blasio announced
that New York City is bringing

00:04:07.679 --> 00:04:10.350 line:0%
back the Macy's Fourth of July
Fireworks Show.

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:11.784 line:0%
-Yeah.

00:04:11.784 --> 00:04:14.520 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:16.222
-Of course,
the big fireworks show

00:04:16.222 --> 00:04:18.323
will immediately be followed
by the Car Alarm Spectacular.

00:04:18.323 --> 00:04:19.892
We have a great show.

